<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]"><strong>Phase 1 — MVP (comme toi maintenant)</strong></p>
<ul class="[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3">
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">WebView / React Native / Flutter</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Rapide à développer</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Moins cher</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Permet de valider l'idée avec de vrais utilisateurs</li>
</ul>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]"><strong>Phase 2 — Croissance</strong></p>
<ul class="[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3">
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Si l'app marche bien (10k+ utilisateurs)</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">On recrute des développeurs natifs Android (Java/Kotlin) et iOS (Swift)</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">On reécrit l'app en natif pour de meilleures performances</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Exemples : Facebook, Instagram, Airbnb ont tous commencé en WebView/hybride</li>
</ul>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]"><strong>Pour toi concrètement :</strong></p>
<ul class="[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3">
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2"><strong>Maintenant</strong> → Capacitor + HTML/JS = parfait pour lancer et valider</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2"><strong>Si ça marche</strong> → tu lèves des fonds ou tu trouves un dev Android natif</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2"><strong>L'important c'est de publier et d'avoir des utilisateurs</strong> — la technologie peut changer après</li>
</ul>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]">La valeur de ton app c'est le <strong>contenu</strong> (18 villes, photos, données) et l'<strong>idée</strong> — pas la technologie. 🚀🇲🇦</p></div></div></div></div></div><div class="flex justify-start opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 group-focus-within:opacity-100 transition" role="group" aria-label="Message actions"><div class="text-text-300"><div class="text-text-300 flex items-stretch justify-between"><button type="button" data-cds="Button" class="cds-reset group/btn relative isolate inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center gap-1.5 whitespace-nowrap select-none border-0 outline-none rounded h-control font-sans text-body font-medium [&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:opacity-50 disabled:pointer-events-none transition-shadow duration-fast focus-visible:shadow-focus text-primary aria-pressed:text-accent aspect-square w-control px-0 !text-muted hover:!text-primary" aria-label="Copier" data-testid="action-bar-copy"><span aria-hidden="true" class="absolute -z-[1] rounded-[inherit] transition-colors duration-fast group-focus-visible/btn:shadow-[inset_0_0_0_1px_var(--cds-page-bg)] bg-transparent group-hover/btn:bg-fill-ghost-hover group-aria-expanded/btn:bg-fill-ghost-hover inset-0 group-aria-pressed/btn:bg-accent group-hover/btn:group-aria-pressed/btn:bg-accent cds-btn-squish "></span><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 "><span class="relative"><span data-cds="Icon" class="transition-all opacity-100 scale-100" aria-hidden="true" style="font-family: var(--font-anthropicons, Anthropicons-Variable); font-feature-settings: &quot;liga&quot; 0; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-style: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; line-height: 1; width: 1em; height: 1em; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex-shrink: 0; user-select: none; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 433.3;"></span><span data-cds="Icon" class="absolute inset-0 transition-all opacity-0 scale-50